1
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:09,740
=The Forgotten Concubine's Revenge=

2
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,740
=Episode 18=

3
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:15,740
(I'll tear that mouth of yours apart!)

4
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,080
It was Consort Qi.

5
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,760
She gave me this packet of red alum

6
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,240
and ordered me

7
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,440
to poison Zhaoyi Rong's medicine.

8
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:25,680
(That wretch.)

9
00:00:25,920 --> 00:00:27,440
(She deceived me)

10
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:28,960
(and dragged me into this!)

11
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:30,800
Your Majesty.

12
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:32,680
Concubine Rou's face
was ruined by Zhaoyi Rong.

13
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:34,240
If anyone wanted revenge, it'd be her.

14
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:35,680
Why would I do such a thing?

15
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:36,920
Your Majesty...

16
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:38,520
I...

17
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:42,000
I never put aconite powder

18
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,600
in her pearl powder.

19
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:45,720
I'm innocent.

20
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:46,520
Your Majesty.

21
00:00:46,520 --> 00:00:48,000
Zhaoyi Rong's maid testified

22
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:48,960
that she heard Zhaoyi Rong

23
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,320
ask Physician Li for aconite powder

24
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:51,720
to ruin Concubine Rou's face.

25
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:53,080
How could she be innocent?

26
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:54,200
Your Majesty.

27
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,000
I...

28
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:57,960
I only asked for

29
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:02,120
aconite powder to improve my health.

30
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:04,160
I never poisoned anyone.

31
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:06,360
I know.

32
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:09,400
Your Majesty.

33
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:11,760
I warned Zhaoyi Rong
that aconite is poisonous

34
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:12,680
and not to misuse it.

35
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,200
But she told me

36
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:15,680
she had a cold constitution

37
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:16,880
and wanted to build her health

38
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:18,120
to bear Your Majesty an heir.

39
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,560
That's why she wanted aconite.

40
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:22,320
So I had her get a prescription
at the Imperial Hospital.

41
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:24,080
That way, everything would be on record,

42
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:26,040
and no one could exploit the matter.

43
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:26,960
Your Majesty.

44
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:28,280
That day,

45
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:30,200
I was too upset about my face.

46
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:31,480
I didn't look into it.

47
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:34,720
But later I questioned
my maid Jinxiu closely.

48
00:01:35,360 --> 00:01:36,520
She told me

49
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:39,160
when she ran into Zhaoyi Rong
at the Imperial Hospital,

50
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:40,480
they only brushed past each other.

51
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:42,120
Zhaoyi Rong had no chance

52
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,920
to tamper with my pearl powder.

53
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,000
But afterward,

54
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:48,160
Consort Qi kept stirring up trouble.

55
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,520
She urged me

56
00:01:49,640 --> 00:01:51,680
to poison Zhaoyi Rong's medicine.

57
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:53,360
I acted on impulse,

58
00:01:53,440 --> 00:01:54,480
blinded by anger,

59
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:56,200
and listened to her.

60
00:01:57,240 --> 00:01:58,640
(Those two wretches!)

61
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,320
(They were in league all along)

62
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:02,000
(and set a trap for me!)

63
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:04,320
Consort Qi.

64
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,720
What do you have to say?

65
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,800
(His Majesty suspects me.)

66
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:12,840
(And the red alum does
trace back to me.)

67
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,360
(If this goes further,)

68
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:16,080
(more secrets may come to light,)

69
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:17,600
(and it'll only hurt me more.)

70
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:19,520
Your Majesty.

71
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,800
Please calm your anger!

72
00:02:21,040 --> 00:02:22,120
I was foolish.

73
00:02:22,240 --> 00:02:23,800
I know I was wrong, Your Majesty!

74
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,080
You...

75
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,480
Consort Qi...

76
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:28,880
I once believed

77
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:30,480
you were gentle and virtuous,

78
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:31,640
kind and considerate.

79
00:02:31,640 --> 00:02:33,640
You were the one I trusted most
in the harem.

80
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:36,000
I never thought you'd be so jealous,

81
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,520
capable of such cruelty.

82
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:38,360
Guards!

83
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:41,000
Your Majesty, I only hated
how they flaunted your favor

84
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,080
and looked down on everyone.

85
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,520
For your favor,

86
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:45,280
they've thrown the harem into chaos.

87
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:48,040
I didn't do it for myself, Your Majesty!

88
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:50,280
Do you remember the late Empress?

89
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:51,640
She was gentle and virtuous,

90
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,480
and never sought conflict.

91
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,760
With her, the harem was serene.

92
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,920
But ever since they came,

93
00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:58,760
the harem's been turned upside down,

94
00:02:58,760 --> 00:02:59,920
leaving no peace at all!

95
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:01,080
Your Majesty.

96
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:03,320
I only wanted to give them

97
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:05,240
a little lesson, Your Majesty.

98
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:08,080
I've been loyal to you
and the late Empress

99
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:09,520
for all these years.

100
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:12,080
Your Majesty, I was just foolish once.

101
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:14,800
For the sake of your bond with
the late Empress,

102
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,960
please spare me this once, Your Majesty!

103
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,000
By my decree.

104
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,360
Consort Qi,

105
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,240
harbored wicked intentions

106
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:33,120
and nearly caused a disaster.

107
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:34,640
Effective immediately,

108
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,480
her authority over the harem is revoked,

109
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:37,960
docked one year's stipend,

110
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:38,960
and confined to reflect on her faults

111
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:40,040
as punishment.

112
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,160
I...

113
00:03:44,040 --> 00:03:45,560
Thank you, Your Majesty.

114
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:54,960
Consort Rong,

115
00:03:55,320 --> 00:03:56,520
I wronged you.

116
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,000
I order the Imperial Hospital

117
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,760
to spare no effort to save Consort Rong.

118
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,200
There must be no mistakes.

119
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,560
Yes, Your Majesty.

120
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:06,240
I will do everything I can.

121
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:09,280
Once you've recovered,

122
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,360
I'll restore your title as consort.

123
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:12,880
Thank you, Your Majesty.

124
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:38,160
Your Highness.

125
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,040
Are you all right?

126
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,520
I'm fine.

127
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:45,120
I took the medicine

128
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:47,040
Physician Li gave me beforehand.

129
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,440
I won't die.

130
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,560
Since Physician Li won't help me,

131
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:55,120
then from now on,
stay out of my affairs.

132
00:04:55,640 --> 00:04:57,040
We should see less of each other.

133
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:11,200
Your Highness, you were right.

134
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,160
There really is

135
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:13,880
a spy for Consort Qi in our palace.

136
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:15,840
The one eavesdropping outside the window

137
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:18,000
was Suxin, one of the menial maids.

138
00:05:19,400 --> 00:05:20,200
Just as I thought.

139
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:22,480
Concubine Rou and I
only pretended to fight

140
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:24,120
to fool Consort Qi

141
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:26,480
and lure her out of the shadows.

142
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,560
Concubine Rou staged a self-sacrifice.

143
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,880
She ruined her own face

144
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:30,760
to frame me,

145
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,640
getting me punished and demoted.

146
00:05:33,200 --> 00:05:35,840
Seeing us fight so viciously,

147
00:05:36,080 --> 00:05:37,440
Consort Qi would surely believe it

148
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,600
and let her guard down.

149
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:41,480
Then Concubine Rou lured her

150
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:42,920
into using red alum

151
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,040
to poison me

152
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,960
and wipe me out.

153
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:49,240
Consort Qi would surely be happy
to sit back and watch us fight.

154
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:52,160
We wanted to draw her into our trap.

155
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:54,040
The moment she acted,

156
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:56,800
she would fall right into it.

157
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:58,880
I never knew

158
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:02,560
the late Empress meant so much
to His Majesty.

159
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:05,520
We paid such a heavy price,

160
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:07,320
yet Consort Qi only had to mention

161
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:09,280
her bond with the late Empress,

162
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:11,200
and he let her off lightly

163
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:12,440
with only

164
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:14,440
a minor punishment.

165
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:15,640
Indeed.

166
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:17,640
The late Empress

167
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:20,720
is her immunity in His Majesty's eyes.

168
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:23,360
We'll have to find another way.

169
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,920
Whatever immunity she has,

170
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:27,440
I only know one thing.

171
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,080
A life for a life.

172
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:32,120
Those who do evil must be punished.

173
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,120
I will never let it slide.

174
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:39,640
Your Highness, it's warmer now.

175
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:42,200
The flowers in the Imperial Garden
are blooming beautifully.

176
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,160
Flowers are in full bloom,

177
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,800
each vying to outshine the others.

178
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:50,560
Isn't that the late Empress's
dear friend,

179
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:51,920
Consort Qi?

180
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:54,840
Consort Rong.

181
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:57,720
Drop the sarcasm.

182
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:01,440
You traitorous wretch!

183
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:04,280
How dare you trick me with sweet talk.

184
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,160
I'll tear that mouth of yours apart!

185
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:10,920
Did the late Empress also

186
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,760
strike people in public

187
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,400
without a second thought?

188
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:16,800
You accuse me of deceiving you,

189
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:19,280
but haven't you deceived me, too?

190
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,560
You two think

191
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:23,720
you can join forces against me?

192
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,360
Then come at me together.

193
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,920
You've hidden your true colors

194
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,280
with your fingers in everything.

195
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:31,360
If we hadn't joined forces,

196
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:33,440
how could we have exposed you?

197
00:07:34,040 --> 00:07:36,400
At the rite for our children,

198
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,280
we swore

199
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:39,240
to get justice

200
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,160
for our murdered children.

201
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,320
Consort Rong.

202
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:49,200
My pretty face is enough to let me
reign supreme over the harem!

203
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,520
In the end,

204
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:53,160
I'm still the most favored one!

205
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:07,600
You're truly pathetic.

206
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:11,360
You grieve so deeply
for the child you lost,

207
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:13,960
and can't let go of being barren.

208
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:17,920
But did you never wonder

209
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:20,880
if it was all done by someone?

210
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:23,640
What are you saying?

211
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:29,200
This prescription

212
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:33,000
was written for you

213
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:34,920
by Physician Song

214
00:08:35,800 --> 00:08:36,960
when you were pregnant.

215
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,760
A pregnancy tonic.

216
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:41,200
Do you know

217
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:42,920
why Physician Song

218
00:08:42,920 --> 00:08:44,760
was punished shortly after
your miscarriage

219
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:48,320
for prescribing the wrong medicine
to Consort Qi

220
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,600
and thrown into death row?

221
00:08:55,860 --> 00:08:56,520
(Cassia twig 3 qian, white peony 3 qian,
fresh kudzu 3 slices, and more)

222
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:58,520
Because Consort Qi ordered him

223
00:08:58,680 --> 00:09:00,520
to tamper with your medicine

224
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:02,480
which caused your miscarriage

225
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:05,040
and left you unable to bear children.

226
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,960
That's why Consort Qi

227
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:09,320
had him silenced.

228
00:09:14,160 --> 00:09:15,280
Impossible.

229
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,840
Consort Qi told me that day

230
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,440
that even if I couldn't bear children,

231
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:21,000
she would still support me

232
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:23,080
in winning His Majesty's favor.

233
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,560
She was always there for me.

234
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:29,000
That's why I always stood by her.

235
00:09:29,800 --> 00:09:31,280
She couldn't have lied to me.

236
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:32,960
No...

237
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:34,640
It can't be.

238
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:37,240
So it wasn't you who silenced Lingxi.

239
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:38,280
It was Consort Qi.

240
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:41,160
You were just taking the blame for her.

241
00:09:41,520 --> 00:09:42,360
Weren't you?

242
00:09:51,160 --> 00:09:53,080
She took my child from me.

243
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:55,120
And she took yours, too.

244
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:57,760
Now she wants us to
tear each other apart.

245
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:00,360
Concubine Rou.

246
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:03,800
Are we really going to play
into her hands?

247
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:23,880
I found something very interesting.

248
00:10:24,680 --> 00:10:26,200
When Concubine Rou was with child,

249
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:27,120
you tended to her

250
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,520
with such devotion,

251
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:29,560
never leaving her side.

252
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:31,480
You even had

253
00:10:31,480 --> 00:10:32,480
Physician Song

254
00:10:32,800 --> 00:10:34,320
personally safeguard her pregnancy.

255
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,920
Concubine Rou was frail.

256
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:42,400
I tended to her myself
while she was with child.

257
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:43,360
What's wrong with that?

258
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:45,280
Nothing wrong with the tonic itself.

259
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:47,120
Astragalus, atractylodes...

260
00:10:47,280 --> 00:10:48,920
They tonify the middle and boost qi,
nourish the blood and preserve yin.

261
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:51,040
Common medicines for pregnancy.

262
00:10:51,360 --> 00:10:52,160
But the problem

263
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:55,160
was all those tonics
you kept giving her.

264
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:56,960
Physician Li told me

265
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,480
that Concubine Rou was distressed,

266
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:00,440
suffering from stagnant liver qi.

267
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:02,040
And the tonics you prescribed

268
00:11:02,240 --> 00:11:04,000
only blocked her qi further,

269
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:05,000
causing internal heat.

270
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:05,840
In the end,

271
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:07,240
the pregnancy couldn't hold,

272
00:11:07,560 --> 00:11:08,840
and she miscarried.

273
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:12,120
Concubine Rou knew none of this.

274
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:14,480
She thought it was simply her fate

275
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:15,680
that she couldn't carry her child.

276
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:19,000
She was grateful for your tender care.

277
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,280
She was flattered.

278
00:11:20,840 --> 00:11:21,880
To repay you,

279
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:22,920
she always took your side.

280
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:24,360
But what did you do?

281
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:26,720
First, you crippled her legs.

282
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:28,280
Then handed her a crutch,

283
00:11:28,360 --> 00:11:29,360
so she'd spend her life

284
00:11:29,800 --> 00:11:31,360
grateful to you.

285
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:36,760
At Lingxi's memorial rite,

286
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:38,440
I told Concubine Rou

287
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:40,360
every secret.

288
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,080
You think you're so clever.

289
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:43,600
So we played along

290
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:44,640
and put on a show for you.

291
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:47,360
She deliberately used aconite
to ruin her face

292
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,960
and got me punished by His Majesty.

293
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:49,960
And I

294
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:52,200
deliberately took Blood-seeing Sorrow
to feign illness.

295
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:53,960
The harder we fought,

296
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:55,720
the safer you felt.

297
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:58,040
You never thought that,
for all your scheming,

298
00:11:58,640 --> 00:12:00,720
you'd fall into our hands.

299
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:05,040
I calculated everything,

300
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:07,080
yet still grew careless.

301
00:12:09,600 --> 00:12:11,320
You once helped me escape
the cold palace.

302
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:14,880
I trusted you deeply back then.

303
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:15,920
Oh, right.

304
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:18,040
I almost forgot.

305
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:20,440
When you left the cold palace,

306
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:22,720
I was the one who helped you.

307
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:23,760
Don't think I don't know

308
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:25,240
what you were scheming.

309
00:12:25,920 --> 00:12:27,080
You got me out of there

310
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:28,720
only to use me

311
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:30,360
to get rid of Noble Consort Hui.

312
00:12:31,520 --> 00:12:33,560
Back then, Concubine Rou
conspired with her

313
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:35,760
and used a Go manual to
approach the eldest prince.

314
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,760
I thought she'd betrayed you.

315
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:40,840
But the young eunuch
who sold her the manual confessed

316
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:43,320
that it was your maid Yinshuang

317
00:12:43,320 --> 00:12:44,400
who had supplied it.

318
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:46,080
You secretly pushed

319
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:47,960
Concubine Rou and
Noble Consort Hui together

320
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,600
to harm the eldest prince,

321
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:52,280
all so you could use the affair
to take down

322
00:12:52,640 --> 00:12:53,720
Noble Consort Hui,

323
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:56,080
the eldest prince and
Concubine Rou all at once.

324
00:12:58,200 --> 00:13:00,480
You always speak of your loyalty
to the late Empress.

325
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:02,680
You raised the eldest prince,

326
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,720
but only to use him

327
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:07,000
as a tool for your killings.

328
00:13:09,880 --> 00:13:10,680
Fu Rong.

329
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:12,760
You really are something.

330
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:15,120
I've truly underestimated you.

331
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:16,840
Consort Qi.

332
00:13:17,560 --> 00:13:18,600
For all these years,

333
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:20,520
I've followed your orders

334
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:22,480
and served you faithfully.

335
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:24,520
Even knowing I might die,

336
00:13:24,840 --> 00:13:27,240
I still tried to help you
eliminate Noble Consort Hui.

337
00:13:27,800 --> 00:13:29,920
But how could you be so cruel

338
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:32,040
as to kill my child?

339
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:33,360
You wretched servant!

340
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:35,800
You think you deserved to
bear His Majesty's child?

341
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:39,400
Insolence!

342
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:40,680
Have you a death wish?

343
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:41,400
Tell me!

344
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:43,520
Why did you hurt my child?

345
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:46,640
While investigating
the second prince's birth,

346
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:48,800
I found that Lingxi wasn't born mute.

347
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:50,200
When she was born,

348
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:51,480
she was given large doses of
ginger-prepared goldthread​

349
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:52,560
which ruined her vocal cords.

350
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:54,760
And your migraines

351
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:56,680
often require
ginger-prepared goldthread​.

352
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:58,280
I went to test you,

353
00:13:58,400 --> 00:13:59,320
but you deflected,

354
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:02,080
saying Concubine Rou
found the remedy for you.

355
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:03,720
Then you killed

356
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:06,240
Dongmei, the maid who
brewed Lingxi's medicine.

357
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:08,160
And finally, you tried to shift
all the blame

358
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:09,600
onto Concubine Rou,

359
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:10,960
making her take the fall for you.

360
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:13,240
So what if I made her take the fall?

361
00:14:14,320 --> 00:14:15,520
I'll tell you, then.

362
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:19,720
Back then, the Imperial Hospital
diagnosed you with a boy.

363
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:22,880
I hadn't even borne a prince yet.

364
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:24,400
How dare you?

365
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:27,440
And you.

366
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:29,440
When Lingxi was born,

367
00:14:29,680 --> 00:14:31,640
His Majesty was overjoyed.

368
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:34,120
You two wretches...

369
00:14:34,280 --> 00:14:35,800
I would never let His Majesty

370
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:37,520
bestow his favor on another's child.

371
00:14:39,640 --> 00:14:40,960
Fortune was on my side.

372
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:42,800
Lingxi got jaundice,

373
00:14:43,200 --> 00:14:44,720
so I gave ginger-prepared goldthread​

374
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:47,000
to Dongmei, the maid who
made her medicine,

375
00:14:47,880 --> 00:14:49,840
and had her silence Lingxi.

376
00:14:53,600 --> 00:14:56,280
Just because you wanted
His Majesty's favor all to yourself,

377
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:58,160
you harmed innocent children.

378
00:14:58,840 --> 00:15:00,520
How can you be so cruel?

379
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:03,440
They were all precious little lives!

380
00:15:03,440 --> 00:15:04,480
They were children!

381
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:05,480
Children?

382
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:08,000
They weren't my children.

383
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:09,640
Why should I care about them?

384
00:15:09,760 --> 00:15:11,120
Why should I pity them?

385
00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:12,960
I would never allow you

386
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,880
to bear His Majesty's child.

387
00:15:15,600 --> 00:15:16,720
If you do,

388
00:15:17,160 --> 00:15:17,920
every last one

389
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:20,200
must die.

390
00:15:23,660 --> 00:15:28,180
♪I've wandered through this world
all my life♪

391
00:15:28,500 --> 00:15:33,220
♪As the years go by,
we learn to be alone♪

392
00:15:33,340 --> 00:15:38,020
♪I see leaves fall from the old tree
by my window♪

393
00:15:38,220 --> 00:15:42,860
♪When flowers bloom and swallows return,
I hope you are still here♪

394
00:15:43,100 --> 00:15:47,620
♪I hear rain whisper in my ear♪

395
00:15:48,020 --> 00:15:52,660
♪I send my longing to you far away♪

396
00:15:52,820 --> 00:15:57,460
♪I wait for dawn to break the mist
and you to find your way home♪

397
00:15:57,780 --> 00:16:02,420
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

398
00:16:02,540 --> 00:16:07,140
♪Let the stars and sea
wait for your return♪

399
00:16:07,380 --> 00:16:10,580
♪Let the stars and sea♪

400
00:16:10,580 --> 00:16:12,580
(Changsheng Gate)

401
00:16:12,580 --> 00:16:15,900
♪Wait for your return♪
